{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>將文件交給他人時，往往只需對方看到其中幾頁，卻連身份證號碼、銀行帳戶等資料一併交出。《Blackout》可在一部裝置內完成偵測與遮蔽，原價 US $2.99，現正限時免費，適合需要提交租約文件、薪資證明或醫療紀錄的用戶。</p>\n\n<h2>自動找出並移除敏感資料</h2>\n<p>開啟 PDF、相片或掃描檔後，應用會在裝置上辨識帳戶號碼、信用卡號碼、電話、地址、出生日期與證件號碼，以及相片中的人臉與條碼。遮蔽並非用黑框覆蓋，而是刪除文字字元與影像像素，同時清除檔案內藏的編輯歷程、註解作者與 GPS 位置，並可為每頁加上水印標示收件對象。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-45-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-46-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-47-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-48-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-49-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-50-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Blackout — Share Safely</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-03T21:58:33.160211+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":312,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}